				<ownedComment annotatedElement="z_eKBoaGAqAC.wya" xmi:id="z_eKBoaGAqAC.wya_documentaiton" xmi:type="uml:Comment">
					<body>Typ av filformat för svaret. &#10;[Så står det nu i informationsmodellen, klassen Svar, attributet &quot;presentationsformat&quot;. Detta behöver knappast finnas med i begreppsmodellen.]&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;Dokument som innehåller den visuella presentationen av laboratoriesvaret.  &#10;   &#10;Men jfr projektet e-remiss, där finns bilaga:  &#10;Dokument som kompletterar ett annat dokument och är avsett att användas tillsammans med detta.   &#10;   &#10;Exempelvis utdrag ur patientjournal, en bild eller liknande som biläggs remissen, eller remissvaret.  &#10;   &#10;Är presentation något annat än bilaga?</body>
					<xmi:Extension extender="Visual Paradigm">
						<htmlValue value="&lt;head&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;&#10;      &lt;!--&#10;        body { color: #000000; font-family: Dialog; font-size: 12px }&#10;      --&gt;&#10;    &lt;/style&gt;&#13;&#10;    &#13;&#10;  &lt;/head&gt;&#13;&#10;  &lt;body&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Times New Roman,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman,serif&quot; size=&quot;11.0pt&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Typ &#13;&#10;      av filformat f&amp;#246;r &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman,serif&quot; size=&quot;11.0pt&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span bgcolor=&quot;#ffff00&quot; style=&quot;background-color:#ffff00;&quot;&gt;svaret&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Times New Roman,serif;&quot;&gt;. &#13;&#10;      &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;span bgcolor=&quot;#ffff00&quot; style=&quot;background-color:#ffff00;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman,serif&quot; size=&quot;11.0pt&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;&quot;&gt;[&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman,serif&quot; size=&quot;11.0pt&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;&quot;&gt;S&amp;#229; &#13;&#10;      st&amp;#229;r det nu i informationsmodellen, klassen Svar, attributet &#13;&#10;      &amp;quot;presentationsformat&amp;quot;. Detta beh&amp;#246;ver knappast finnas med i &#13;&#10;      begreppsmodellen.]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;      &#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p&gt;&#13;&#10;      Dokument som inneh&amp;#229;ller den visuella presentationen av laboratoriesvaret.&lt;o p=&quot;#DEFAULT&quot;&gt;&lt;/o&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p class=&quot;SoSTabelltext&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;o p=&quot;#DEFAULT&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &amp;nbsp;&lt;/o&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p class=&quot;SoSTabelltext&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;span background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;Men &#13;&#10;      jfr projektet e-remiss, d&amp;#228;r finns &lt;i&gt;bilaga&lt;/i&gt;:&lt;o background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; p=&quot;#DEFAULT&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/o style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p class=&quot;SoSTabelltext&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;span background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;Dokument &#13;&#10;      som kompletterar ett annat dokument och &amp;#228;r avsett att anv&amp;#228;ndas &#13;&#10;      tillsammans med detta. &lt;o background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; p=&quot;#DEFAULT&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/o style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p class=&quot;SoSTabelltext&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;span background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;o background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; p=&quot;#DEFAULT&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &amp;nbsp;&lt;/o style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p class=&quot;SoSTabelltext&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;span background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;Exempelvis &#13;&#10;      utdrag ur patientjournal, en bild eller liknande som bil&amp;#228;ggs remissen, &#13;&#10;      eller remissvaret.&lt;o background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; p=&quot;#DEFAULT&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/o style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;p class=&quot;SoSTabelltext&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &lt;span background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;o background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; p=&quot;#DEFAULT&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&#13;&#10;      &amp;nbsp;&lt;/o style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;/p&gt;&#13;&#10;    &lt;span background-image=&quot;null&quot; background-position=&quot;null&quot; style=&quot;background-color:yellow;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;font-size:11.0pt;font-family:Times New Roman,serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman,serif&quot; size=&quot;11.0pt&quot; style=&quot;font-size:11.0pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;#196;r &#13;&#10;    &lt;i&gt;presentation&lt;/i&gt; n&amp;#229;got annat &amp;#228;n &lt;i&gt;bilaga&lt;/i&gt;?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&#13;&#10;  &lt;/body&gt;"/>
					</xmi:Extension>
				</ownedComment>
			</ownedMember>
